Runtime dependencies
--------------------
The package uses rawpy (and its LibRaw decoder), NumPy, SciPy, Pillow,
tifffile, and ExifRead. Optional scene-assisted processing uses OpenCV.
ExifTool is an optional external executable. Each dependency retains its own
license and notices. The project lockfiles record resolved versions; consult
the distributions and upstream projects for their accompanying license terms.
Dependencies are installed separately, not vendored in the project source.

Implementation references
-------------------------
This product includes DNG technology under license by Adobe.
The DNG writer follows Adobe's published Digital Negative specification:
https://helpx.adobe.com/camera-raw/digital-negative.html

RAW decoding uses rawpy's public API:
https://letmaik.github.io/rawpy/api/rawpy.RawPy.html

Sony maker-note interpretation is obtained through ExifTool:
https://github.com/exiftool/exiftool/blob/master/lib/Image/ExifTool/Sony.pm

No Adobe camera profiles, Sony camera software, or proprietary RAW decoding
code are included in this repository.

